{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe48dc3fe24968227edae4384ecdd1fb657ddd5006b80cdb7bd2569c15a6f336", "ja": "いやぁ、まいったな……。\nあ、お疲れさまです。青羽さん。", "zh": "哎呀，真伤脑筋啊……\n啊，辛苦了，青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "fefe35c44c838b30dfbfeb5d933672788b5e1712e5a7c57feb197b58f5847e69", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nさっき社長さんから、お電話がありましたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n刚才社长打电话来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "391ef38a69aa5f261c0f5c187e64916fa8ad126a66671e15aaf725b149035b0f", "ja": "なんでも、「ピリッとしたお話」があるそうです。\n事務所に顔を出してほしいって言ってました。", "zh": "听说是有件“严肃的事情”要谈。\n他说希望您能到事务所来一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6a6dff44c357b407d6ee1c18b50d498e0654f2d422c4cc419938c1283cba5003", "ja": "おっと、ありがとうございます！\nでも、それだと尚更マズいな、これだと……。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢您！\n不过这样一来就更糟糕了，这下可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "64f8f736609e697043e62a93bc041ab1a2c5ecfb39ddcd4a9a513fff562c50ed", "ja": "どうかしたんですか？　……ややっ！\nシャツについたその大きなシミは……もしかして！？", "zh": "怎么了？……呀！\n您衬衫上那一大片污渍……难道是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ffda57d64524fc723f55d3943081276e54ae1fa69a68726fc8f8a7c3a4d6187c", "ja": "そうなんですよ。\n外で昼食を食べたとき、やってしまいまして……。", "zh": "是这样的。\n在外面吃午饭的时候，不小心弄上去的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "f7222d208c82bc64a1135d352f3000d278fd8229720b5462049351aafbdc3f40", "ja": "早くシミ抜きしなくちゃ！　すぐ準備しますから、\nそのシャツ、脱いでもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "得赶紧把污渍洗掉才行！我马上准备，您可以把那件衬衫脱下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "528bc25ab52d89374d286d8b283eae003941b2fa57023ad24c2e10ceddb32afe", "ja": "すみません、お願いします。\nやはりカレーうどんは白いシャツの天敵ですね……。", "zh": "不好意思，拜托你了。\n果然咖喱乌冬是白衬衫的天敌啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "a63258ec0c5235d94b197549d7c2374ed2d4dd9dd668489876bb8c2f9964f895", "ja": "カレー……うどん！　ああっ！", "zh": "咖喱……乌冬面！啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "e7136043ecca1783b38a94d05444ecc9ce64557cf452ba9794110424fe3ae7bc", "ja": "そっか。カレーうどんにアレンジしちゃえば、\n辛さもマイルドになるよね……うん、いいかも♪", "zh": "这样啊。改成咖喱乌冬面的话，辣味也会变得柔和一些……嗯，或许不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "edbfcf258d464854a24177d8ca98a02a7093179e9e41f24b757386315db2e323", "ja": "ナイスなアイディア、ありがとうございます！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "真是个好主意，谢谢您！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c1d63357353da0e2563c13a77c5d5478239599d74cf920bc34d6ea343f8587b9", "ja": "え？　なんだかよくわかりませんが……。\nお礼を言うのは、こっちですよ。", "zh": "咦？虽然有点搞不明白……该道谢的是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "491f73216fdbae631c991fcb24a8e66d5fea48ee617aa3aeaa0dca0109ee2e30", "ja": "いえいえ！\nこれで、お姉ちゃんとケンカしなくてすみそうです！", "zh": "哪里哪里！\n这下应该就不用跟姐姐吵架了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4a9066003472e75ac41d589e16680c9c87ffa9b723fed378c6e7134d81dfe231", "ja": "それは良かったです？　とにかく、\nシャツのシミ抜きが終わったら、事務所に行きますね！", "zh": "那太好了？总之，等把衬衫上的污渍洗掉后，我就去事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "f13e89078440eeda70282a90ceafa65f90a001ea8d7c5540e12c21ddd74a2bfd", "ja": "任せてください！　シャツは真っ白に仕上げますから♪\nそれじゃ、行ってきますね♪", "zh": "交给我吧！我会把衬衫洗得雪白的♪\n那么，我先走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cd67a29bd2e2094ab520104940d8579cd2a7ba17697edccf4c972ffa60b78827", "ja": "お疲れ様です、社長、音無さん！\n何かお話があると聞きましたが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长、音无小姐！\n听说您有事要谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "ebd8f765ef307ed5317fa4bec74c8c7bd12dcfd33698b5d0f73509b0fddf5ffd", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n社長がソワソワしながらお待ちですよ♪", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n社长正坐立不安地等着您呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "167a855fb210c775fc403bc8356707edeca49d7ed05827db37902bc2785649a2", "ja": "やあやあやあ、君！　待ってたよ～！\n嬉しい報せをいち早く君に伝えたくてね。", "zh": "呀呀呀，是你！等你好久啦～！\n我想尽早把这个好消息告诉你嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "0bcd706562c60ff4a9fba0dd3ed2c58507db8ff3e54b0d1e9424d803fe9e315c", "ja": "実は……我が765プロのアイドル、望月杏奈君に\nオファーが届いたんだ！", "zh": "其实……我们765事务所的偶像，望月杏奈同学\n收到了演出邀请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2816996b0fc33b404f7e1e91a7a50affb4cefdaaa007d6834e7b2068662197f6", "ja": "おお、杏奈に！　それは確かに嬉しい報せですね！\nどんな内容なんでしょうか？", "zh": "哦，是杏奈的！那确实是个令人高兴的消息！\n具体是什么内容呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "24a7ce240d51d3b5c0c9372bd5de2ff16e2ec14c87cbe94c811fb84932699397", "ja": "ああ。杏奈君は、ゲーム誌でコラムを連載していたね。\n先方がそれを見て、今回打診してくれたそうだ。", "zh": "啊。杏奈，你之前在游戏杂志上连载过专栏吧。\n听说对方看到了那个，所以这次来找你洽谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "d600e300d9f94c44b517511e95b9dd7d18a798b1b9f18ed338eb05c729962ec7", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんのコラム、「ガチのゲーマーならではの\n視点が面白い！」って、評判らしいですもんね。", "zh": "听说杏奈的专栏“只有真正的游戏玩家才有的视角，特别有意思！”评价很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "de2024e41e1d36f302b3281b3302165a193414442714c915950857bc721d122e", "ja": "ええ、そうみたいですね。\nということは……オファー元はゲーム会社ですか？", "zh": "嗯，好像确实是这样。\n这么说来……是游戏公司发来的邀约吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "a021cf80e568992f6b09ae1e8156e00085eb4c31ab8bcbe87ad08eb0b248b2ff", "ja": "いいや。大手の食品会社からでね。", "zh": "不是，是一家大型食品公司寄来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3c46a598dff3a6fb524ad45b5181145ef6f83b48fc68a1ab3c9cd2d362fd98c3", "ja": "え？　ゲーム雑誌のコラムを見て、\n食品会社から……？", "zh": "诶？看了游戏杂志的专栏，食品公司就……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "0f467bfe2df162ed5efaf07481637c9c68a8ce806f6a577f4780d5a3262c1591", "ja": "そうなんだ……コホン！　望月杏奈君完全監修の\n『ゲーミングカレー』商品化プロジェクト！", "zh": "原来如此……咳咳！由望月杏奈全程监修的《游戏咖喱》商品化企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "65665597b3b57fe1fc22746e03b7b593800e6fb325ca1a4102ddedff417ad8e4", "ja": "……という企画だ。販売時のプロモーションも、\n引き続き、765プロに任せてもらえるそうだよ。", "zh": "……就是这样一个企划。据说销售时的宣传活动，也会继续交给765制作人负责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "123e3990a9f1d777b1c7264ec1c095b195b15cdd9af09321e4c8eeb9c05d581e", "ja": "『ゲーミングカレー』……不思議な名前ですね。\nカレーを使った新しいゲーム、とかでしょうか？", "zh": "“游戏咖喱”……真是个奇怪的名字呢。\n难道是使用咖喱制作的新游戏之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7d687231c9982a3ebe98641e06102a4129700f1e5463abbc86b36b971ebfa361", "ja": "いえ、ゲーミングというのはおそらく、\n『ゲーム用の』という意味だと思います。", "zh": "不，这里的电竞大概是指\n“游戏专用”的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "90786daba167a2e5ed3d326d71693be67df1ac5057e0bdf180ba295d938022f9", "ja": "なるほど！　ゲーミングPCとかよく聞きますもんね！\nでもそれだと……ゲーム用のカレーってことですか？", "zh": "原来如此！我经常听到“游戏电脑”之类的说法呢！\n不过这样一来……就是游戏专用的咖喱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "02cb9cb9c8e5cd0a1099850502bcf13981131d5f860ce3133354c7e37c113030", "ja": "詳しくは、企画書を読んでくれたまえ。\n商品は全国展開し、CMに新曲を流すと聞いている！", "zh": "详情请阅读企划书。\n据悉商品将在全国铺货，并在广告中播放新曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "1d26f7431b86eda30fceda54b1fbfaa5886ad559b1d8df9df1b5b479576ad527", "ja": "なんとも熱意の溢れる企画じゃないか！\nこの企画、君はどう思うかね？", "zh": "真是个热情洋溢的企划啊！\n这个企划，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_1033", "source_sha256": "236b3aa5a77bcfea59b3ec555b1dfdee71b2d9e10b3718f68874c7bf39905678", "ja": "燃えます！", "zh": "燃起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bbfe2959d502deb1683cc5a47fa37ccaddc05f6ca6da0b3f74f6f54728711bb9", "ja": "これは、燃えてきましたね……。\n可能なら、ぜひお引き受けしたいです！", "zh": "这个，已经燃起来了呢……\n如果可以的话，我非常愿意接下这个任务！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "00b6d2618a44981c31b88f62e2ce6f719ff4e4828ccaa845bd97df6d744a174d", "ja": "おお！　君ならそう言ってくれると思っていたよ！\n杏奈君と『ゲーミングカレー』、期待しているよ！", "zh": "哦哦！我就知道你会这么说！\n我很期待你和杏奈君的《游戏咖喱》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "212cd57ea575a16aa55fc54a59ff6fa068df8777419b7ed7d4f446c0ea9b6316", "ja": "うふふっ、私もすごい楽しみです！\n一体、どんなカレーになるのかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，我也非常期待呢！\n到底会做出什么样的咖喱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "22c9b1d7199660d4ad399ba51fdc976ed37a8fc173b6d91339a980bc0b3c6921", "ja": "さすがに、七色に光ったりはしません……よね？", "zh": "毕竟不会发出七色的光……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "10459a3358e964e4e374c3d720b75f76abc1c3c8f1428e037b0805e58b81fa46", "ja": "（奇抜な企画だけど、確かに熱意を感じる内容だ！\n杏奈のコラムがきっかけというのも、縁を感じるな）", "zh": "（企划虽然很奇特，但内容确实能感受到热情！\n而且还是由杏奈的专栏引发的，总觉得很有缘分啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "fb77ba66baa1ae6c251d98fd1c818312f139e080c89ac5d7b7eb1fa53ce679b3", "ja": "（でも、まずは杏奈の意志を確かめてみないとな。\n企画を進めるのは、それからだ！）", "zh": "（不过，首先得确认一下杏奈的意愿。\n等那之后再推进企划吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
